{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05347","headline":"春怨 · 郑愔","name":"春怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春朝物候妍，愁妇镜台前。\n风吹数蝶乱，露洗百花鲜。\n试出褰罗幌，还来着锦筵。\n曲中愁夜夜，楼上别年年。\n不及随萧史，高飞向紫烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}